 to get up close to find your next clue.\nThis VR experience is best if played in an open area, as it is designed to track your headset position in worldspace.", "short_description": "\u00bfAre you ready to take ghostbusting into your own hands? Find the elements to complete the ritual, and escape the room."}]}, "developer_name": "Mindfly Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mindflystudio.github.io/Privacy-Policy-Ethereal/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mindfly Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mindflystudio.hirbo.mx/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1485698000204323"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1120018024135233"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1120018024135233"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794549600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1120018024135233"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1482202950553828", "version": "0.1.8"}, "id": "28352646951081368", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typ